#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0666 expect=violation domain=ADNCA
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when DOSPCTDF is populated but DOSEP and DOSEA are not populated in an ADNCA v1.0 dataset.
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADNCA
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col DOSPCTDF type=Char
col DOSEP type=Char
col DOSEA type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col NFRLT type=Num
col AFRLT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Y |  | | CONC | 0 | 0.5
---
